"Name: \FU:RV_DELIVERY_CREATE\SE:BEGIN\EI
ENHANCEMENT 0 ZGTSD_EH_RV_DELIVERY_CREATE.
* 적송 신규 DO 생성 - 납품유형을 지정 한다.
*                 1. FM 'ZGTSD_JS_DO_CREATE' 에서 EXPORT MEMORY ID 'ZGTSDR2010_NDC'
  DATA: LT_JSDOINFO TYPE TABLE OF ZGTSDS0030.

  IMPORT LT_JSDOINFO FROM MEMORY ID 'ZGTSDR2010_NDC'.
  IF LT_JSDOINFO[] IS NOT INITIAL.
    DATA(LS_TEMP) = VALUE #( LT_JSDOINFO[ 1 ] OPTIONAL ).
    IF LS_TEMP-FLAG_JS IS NOT INITIAL AND
       LS_TEMP-VKORG   EQ '6000'      AND
       LS_TEMP-LFART   IS NOT INITIAL.
      I_LIEFERART = LS_TEMP-LFART.
    ENDIF.
  ENDIF.

ENDENHANCEMENT.
